# Cloudflare Pages headers (the origin since the 2026-08-02 cutover — .htaccess is dead here).
# Security baseline per docs/optimization-backlog.md §12.1.
# HSTS deliberately WITHOUT includeSubDomains (mail/webmail subdomains not guaranteed HTTPS)
# and WITHOUT preload (near-irreversible — owner's call, docs/business-facts.md §F).
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), interest-cohort=()

# Fingerprinted build assets are immutable by construction.
/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
